{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-01_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-01","title":"昨日，谷壳将裂","storyCode":"R8-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"6c203441c54108ada30a0fb68e57a73fe7d793504eb16660b416242729904f58","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"公爵之女遵循了内心的正义，然而源自正义的善行无法带来善意的结果。因为她所背负的阴影从未放弃吞噬她的意志。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有砍掉你的手，爬起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......别以为事情就这么完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就剐了你的舌头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......他跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷，您没事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你都做了啥！啊呀，塔露拉......你看看你都做了啥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，再过两天我们就要迁村子了。你看看你这样......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你打了纠察队啊！这可惹上大麻烦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"继续让他打你更不是办法。现在已经晚了，他逃了。我现在杀了他，其他人发现他踪迹的时候，我们就已经迁走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可那样死活是避不过的，纠察队一旦集结起来，一定还会找上我们。说不定还会报复我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还动手！这该怎么办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，爷爷，他们是找感染者。现在他们还不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道我接下来要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷，没事的。来，我扶你回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你这条腿......可有得治了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。没想到我也到了被你搀着这天。我一直觉得我的身体还好着，只是没想到还是没逃过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，我有件事，你一定要听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"又是什么事，爷爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老汉","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是什么来着？唔，哈哈，对不住，我忘啦。你看看，你看我这记性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"您那忘性可还真够大的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
